## Disclaimer

This catalogue describes hardware that switches mains electricity, moves water,
and controls CO₂ — all of which can injure people, destroy property, or kill a
crop when they fail.

The information here is provided **as is, without warranty of any kind**.
Deployment counts, prices and failure modes reflect one facility's experience at
a point in time and may not apply to your conditions. Nothing here is
professional electrical, horticultural or safety advice.

Electrical work must comply with your local regulations and, where required, be
carried out or certified by a licensed electrician. Read [SAFETY.md](SAFETY.md)
before connecting any of this to a valve, heater or contactor, and put a
physical backstop under the software one.

You are responsible for verifying that any part or configuration is suitable and
safe for your installation.
